<main class="wrap" id="reports"><p class="eyebrow">Service and settlement</p><h1>Daily reports.</h1><p>Food sales follow the dining date. Receipts and refunds follow the date money was recorded. All dates use Asia/Manila.</p><p class="fine-print">Academic preview · recorded cash and externally completed card transactions only. This app does not transfer money.</p><form id="report-filter"><label>Report date · Manila<input type="date" name="date" required disabled></label><button type="submit" class="button" disabled>Load daily report</button></form><p id="report-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="report-content" aria-busy="true"><p>Loading daily report…</p></div><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to load daily reports.</p></noscript></main></body></html>
